cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or research, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "Exodus BIP-39 Recovery Research"

authors:
  - family-names: "Sánchez Expósito"
    given-names: "Tomás"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-3715-8516"

type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-20

repository-code: "https://github.com/tomassanchezexposito/exodus-bip39-recovery-research"

license: Apache-2.0

abstract: >-
  Reproducible research and local software for authorized recovery
  and verification of Exodus BIP-39 wallets. The project examines
  local encrypted wallet backups, BIP-39 mnemonic reconstruction,
  BIP-32/BIP-44 hierarchical deterministic derivation, Ethereum
  address verification, EIP-7702 transaction data, and the distinction
  between deterministic representations and genuine reductions of
  cryptographic entropy.

keywords:
  - BIP-39
  - BIP-32
  - BIP-44
  - Bitcoin
  - Ethereum
  - Exodus
  - wallet recovery
  - hierarchical deterministic wallets
  - EIP-7702
  - cryptography
  - cryptocurrency
